/a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;110&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-13</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Lord of Battles, Foehammer, protect me in the battle to come. Let my sword ring true against the armies of the Absolute. Let me live to see another day.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715044852\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1218/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21223/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4940/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936631/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.040      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.040      1 -total\n 50.15%   19.579      5 Template:Icon_text\n 45.23%   17.657     13 Template:Trim\n 25.63%   10.007      2 Template:Uid\n 16.60%    6.479      1 Template:Main_only\n 15.01%    5.861      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.93%    4.657      1 Template:Notes\n 11.32%    4.421      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.22%    4.379      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31456-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715044852 and revision id 237243. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}